    <string name="need_help">Need help?</string>
    <string name="email_us">Email us</string>
    <string name="step1_title">Create or join a pool</string>
    <string name="step1_text">In Pools, tap + to create one, or the join button to paste the invite link or code you were sent.</string>
    <string name="step2_title">Make your picks</string>
    <string name="step2_text">Open the pool and use − and + to set each match\'s score. Picks save automatically: you\'ll see “Picks saved” at the bottom.</string>
    <string name="step3_title">Before kickoff</string>
    <string name="step3_text">You can change a pick as often as you like until kickoff. Then the match closes.</string>
    <string name="step4_title">Climb the standings</string>
    <string name="step4_text">Points are added when each match ends. Check Standings inside your pool.</string>
    <string name="rule_exact">Exact score</string>
    <string name="rule_exact_example">You picked 2-1 and it ended 2-1</string>
    <string name="rule_result_example">You picked 1-0 and it ended 3-1</string>
    <string name="rule_miss_example">You picked 1-1 and it ended 0-2</string>
    <string name="faq1_q">How do I create a pool?</string>
    <string name="faq1_a">In Pools, tap +, give it a name and pick the season. Add an entry fee and a description if you like. Then invite your friends from ⋮ › Invite friends.</string>
    <string name="faq2_q">How do I invite my friends?</string>
    <string name="faq2_a">Open your pool, tap ⋮ › Invite friends (or touch and hold the pool in the list), then share the link by WhatsApp, message or email. Your friends open it, or paste it in the app with the join button.</string>
    <string name="faq3_q">Why can\'t I change a match?</string>
    <string name="faq3_a">Picks close at kickoff. Closed matches show a lock and no longer have buttons.</string>
    <string name="faq4_q">What do “To play” and “All” mean?</string>
    <string name="faq4_a">“To play” shows only the matches you can still pick. “All” includes closed matches and the season\'s results.</string>
    <string name="faq5_q">Can I see other players\' picks?</string>
    <string name="faq5_a">Yes: in your pool, tap ⋮ › Round detail. You\'ll see everyone\'s picks and points for each match once it starts; before that, only yours.</string>
    <string name="faq6_q">What happens if there\'s a tie in the standings?</string>
    <string name="faq6_a">Whoever has more exact scores ranks higher.</string>
    <string name="faq7_q">How often are results updated?</string>
    <string name="faq7_a">Usually a few minutes after each match ends; in rare cases, the next day. Pull down on any list to refresh it.</string>
    <string name="faq8_q">How does the simulator work?</string>
    <string name="faq8_a">Enter or randomize the scores of the remaining matches and see how the Liga MX table would end up. The simulation is only saved on your phone and doesn\'t count toward your pools.</string>
    <string name="faq9_q">How do I change the language?</string>
    <string name="faq9_a">The app is in Spanish and English and follows your phone\'s language. On Android 13 or later you can change it just for this app in More › Language.</string>
    <string name="faq10_q">I forgot my password</string>
    <string name="faq10_a">On the sign-in screen, tap “Forgot your password?”. We\'ll email you a link to create a new one; it\'s valid for one hour.</string>

